# Deployment and environments

Production currently serves **LIVE** Stripe (`LIVE_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=true`). Payment architecture is **PRODUCTION-FROZEN**. Pushing `main` may auto-deploy on Vercel — do not treat a tooling-only push as a product release, but confirm no runtime files changed.

Do not flip Live off as a side effect. Emergency kill switch only after a verified Live money invariant failure. Historical checklist: `docs/legal/live-activation-checklist.md`.

Do not deploy solely because Cursor rules/docs/tests changed unless runtime code changed.

User-facing payment work: TEST deploy + live browser QA before **Production Ready TEST**. If you cannot log in: **IMPLEMENTED — LIVE QA REQUIRED**.
